    <data name="TTH_Guilde_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Plenty to do today, as always![pause=20] The guild never really sleeps.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Plage_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Listen to the waves.[pause=20] They always bring something onto the sand.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Carrefour_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Everyone passes through here.[pause=20] Guild above, town below, sea to the south.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Dojo_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>One well-placed strike beats ten wild ones.[pause=20] Again.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Falaise_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>From up here, you see the boats long before they land.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Cafe_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Do sit down.[pause=20] A cold drink sets you right after the road.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Source_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The water stays warm all year.[pause=20] Nobody really knows why.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TTH_Ambiance" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Busy today.[pause=20] Makes a change.</value>
